1
00:00:00,143 --> 00:00:02,360
Building permanent bases on the Moon and Mars

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:05,422
costs billions, and leaves no room for failure.

3
00:00:05,462 --> 00:00:08,748
Before liftoff, we need to test everything here on Earth.

4
00:00:08,788 --> 00:00:12,348
We built a 3D platform that cross-references NASA data

5
00:00:12,388 --> 00:00:15,801
with 14 Earth analogs — including in Brazil.

6
00:00:15,841 --> 00:00:18,642
Our model evaluates 19 scientific uses,

7
00:00:18,682 --> 00:00:21,572
and shows exactly where each analogy fails.

8
00:00:21,612 --> 00:00:23,138
There is no clone of Mars.

9
00:00:23,625 --> 00:00:26,585
But by exposing the real limits of each site,

10
00:00:26,625 --> 00:00:29,738
we replace guesswork with safe mission decisions.

